---
// Linked from the RadioCast store listing; keep this URL stable.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base lang="en" title="RadioCast privacy policy" description="Privacy policy for the RadioCast Android app.">
  <article class="container-page prose max-w-3xl pt-12 md:pt-20">
    <p class="eyebrow">RadioCast</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted italic">Last updated: Oct 18, 2026</p>

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      RadioCast is an Android app that streams radio stations to Chromecast devices. This app does not collect, store, or
      share any personal data.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Collection</h2>
    <p>RadioCast does not collect any personal information. Specifically:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>No personal data is collected</li>
      <li>No usage analytics or tracking</li>
      <li>No advertising or ad identifiers</li>
      <li>No cookies or similar tracking technologies</li>
      <li>No accounts or registration required</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Local Storage</h2>
    <p>
      The app stores your favorite stations list locally on your device using Android SharedPreferences. This data never
      leaves your device and is not accessible to us or any third party.
    </p>

    <h2>Network Access</h2>
    <p>The app requires internet access solely to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Stream radio audio to your Chromecast device</li>
      <li>Search for radio stations via the public <a href="https://www.radio-browser.info">Radio Browser API</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>No personal information is transmitted during these requests.</p>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      The app uses the Google Cast SDK to enable Chromecast functionality. Google's privacy policy applies to Cast-related
      data processing: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>This app does not knowingly collect any data from children or any other users.</p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>Any updates to this privacy policy will be reflected on this page with an updated revision date.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this privacy policy, you can contact us via <a href="mailto:radiocast@boydroid.nl"
        >radiocast@boydroid.nl</a
      >
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
